{"id":"c489124090a894d6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-r-resolution-derivation.md","title":"有限R归结推导与反驳","display":"df-r-resolution-derivation — 有限R归结推导与反驳","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-r-resolution-derivation","aliases":["72-df-r-resolution-derivation"],"display":"df-r-resolution-derivation — 有限R归结推导与反驳","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]]","[[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2–2.6.3 print61–62/PDF73–74; explicit finite derivation interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-r-resolution-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-r-resolution-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-r-resolution-derivation — 有限R归结推导与反驳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb7ab4318ec98937\" href=\"?note=bb7ab4318ec98937\" title=\"72-df-first-order-r-resolution\">72-df-first-order-r-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4450994380fbceab\" href=\"?note=4450994380fbceab\" title=\"72-df-first-order-clause-validity\">72-df-first-order-clause-validity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2–2.6.3 print61–62/PDF73–74; explicit finite derivation interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。任意二父R步可先交换两父，因此正文字父始终写在前。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D):\\Longleftrightarrow &amp;\\ 0&lt;|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\operatorname{RRes}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,\\pi_i)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F):\\Longleftrightarrow &amp;\\ \\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D):\\Longleftrightarrow &amp;\\ 0&lt;|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\operatorname{RRes}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,\\pi_i)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F):\\Longleftrightarrow &amp;\\ \\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前提行严格早于结论行，故不允许循环“证明”；F即使无限，每份推导也只读取有限多个输入子句。这里的唯一推理步是源书合并因子化的R步，没有暗中添加削弱、额外实例或等式规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-r-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"bb7ab4318ec98937","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-clause-validity","status":"resolved","id":"4450994380fbceab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D):\\Longleftrightarrow &\\ 0<|\\pi|\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=D\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<|\\pi|\\ \\bigl[\\pi_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\ \\operatorname{RRes}(\\pi_j,\\pi_k,\\pi_i)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F):\\Longleftrightarrow &\\ \\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1606,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count"